OL,3,GNEWSAMacbeth run cut short at Oldham
OL,4,Anightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe curtain has come down early on a
OL,7,Fproduction in a town's last remaining
OL,8,Fnightclub of one of Shakespeare's most
OL,9,Ffamous tragedies.
OL,11,FThe Oldham Coliseum Theatre's version
OL,12,Fof Macbeth began previews at Liquid and
OL,13,FEnvy on 23 October and had been due to
OL,14,Frun until 7 November.
OL,16,FThe theatre apologised and said all
OL,17,Fticket holders would automatically
OL,18,Freceive full refunds. Cast and crew
OL,19,Fmembers will be paid in line with their
OL,20,Fcontracts.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
