OL,3,GNEWSAMacbeth run cut short at Oldham
OL,4,Anightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FOldham Council said it was disappointed
OL,7,Fand would work with the Coliseum's
OL,8,Fboard to understand the "unforeseen
OL,9,Fcircumstances" behind the decision.
